  "body": "* 2 bedroom 2 bathroom 1960's apartment elevated to capture wide views across Mission Bay and beyond.\r\n* Spacious open-plan kitchen dining and living creates an easy sociable space for everyday living and entertaining\r\n* Secure entry and lift access to the first floor provide easy, low-maintenance living.\r\n* Secure parking plus off street parking for second car plus visitor park, wonderful storage, a bonus for an apartment.\r\n* Close walk to good restaurants cafes and cinema,  \r\n* Regular bus or good walking and biking along the waterfront.\r\n* A wonderful convenient home for retirees, downsizers, or professionals-perfect for living in or locking up and leaving.\r\n\r\nPhotos are from the previous listing.  Don't delay; call me today.",
